{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4f5e3cdc2708b6af1ff941aa9362a2e0c8a10f82d8e167fbef92d490b35df9e2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:956c8307ea3b3f3f1af6a5e6c25a4cd78b858cde7e63f4bc62dd2b495108bc10",
      "text": "将祝贺之心寄托于琴音",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce7976472a260532e8fa7a0fd244e144137effd4bdd80645608a1348d697a7c3",
      "text": "圭的生日临近，\n丽正在烦恼该如何庆祝。\n和制作人商量后，他前去询问圭本人\n生日有没有什么想要的东西，\n然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76b5daac3e3067c25ba6401b0d0a6e691ba2a7d57a1e9d0260a835200e13b64a",
      "text": "距离都筑先生过来，\n还有一点时间吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8320ab0d8c1e4a34007aee037c095ae15097e6596e3ec6ad7d15598c6b384a9",
      "text": "虽然为了能献上优秀的演奏\n进行了反复练习，但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:525a73e540d23cde22b3107c08b649f6f6890b147985c93b3aca8896f2663bf2",
      "text": "像这样干等着\n也静不下心来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f07d34507560850173ef6ff832c0324f91f1d7008df7502b59d8d2c913b795e5",
      "text": "如果是在练习室的话，\n发出声音应该也不会打扰到别人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4bf564ce84008bd3358278278eab3013e4129716324608bef580e17150f623c",
      "text": "保险起见，最后再排练一次吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:311bccfe31711c9ed63d04f15701557d839b2df3f7d887617d71d7328919da1c",
      "text": "丽先生，谢谢你今天那场精彩的演奏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4a91f83cc04183a3e81eba2a6a0fb845ef5d57f39dc6223e96e66cb5ad60adf",
      "text": "您能喜欢\n真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f442ade9d2decbd23722abc6345566437fa25946c1d9356987b2338b94a740b5",
      "text": "下次有机会的话，\n我也想一起合奏呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc72b966760e776e7ba16e4f0861f887c209e1b086b296cfe8f89cab7edec539",
      "text": "好的，非常乐意。\n我也很想和都筑先生一起演奏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9adc2d9bd83992ba8e167af443cb09d27ab8121c3d647be1f32ff8150c405028",
      "text": "两个人合奏的话选什么曲子好呢，\n得先好好想想呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
